        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "This within-student two-way-fixed-effects estimate uses the balanced panel (school-clustered SE 0.040; N=24,210). It is an observational difference-in-differences estimate of enrollment, not the earlier pilot’s cutoff-based causal estimate.",
